{{> TitleBlock title="How do I unsubscribe from this email?"}}
{{!--
  The link, when the sending worker knows how to build it.

  This partial is included by the alert, incident, monitor, probe and
  status-page owner families. Only the workers that set
  `notificationSettingsLink` get the link; every other template keeps today's
  four-level menu-path sentence until its worker is updated, which is what
  makes this safe to land one producer at a time.

  The page is behind authentication, so this is not RFC 8058 one-click
  unsubscribe - it is one hop instead of a four-hop menu path the reader has
  to remember. No List-Unsubscribe header is claimed for it.
--}}
{{#if notificationSettingsLink}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Change or turn off these notifications in your OneUptime notification settings:"}}
{{> InfoBlock info=notificationSettingsLink}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info="You can go to OneUptime Dashboard > More > User Settings > Notification Settings to unsubscribe from this email."}}
{{/if}}
